@gateway = https://localhost:7000
@accessToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@operationId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@schoolId = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@documentId = REPLACE_LOCALLY

### Gateway readiness (does not aggregate owner readiness)
GET {{gateway}}/health/ready

### Public signing metadata
GET {{gateway}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### Login (use a verified local synthetic account)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: gateway-local-login

{"email":"synthetic@example.test","password":"REPLACE_LOCALLY"}

### Current global profile
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: gateway-local-profile

### School-owned vehicle catalogue (same school namespace, different owner)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Issue a short-lived authenticated URL through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/download?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Never exposed publicly: expect 404
POST {{gateway}}/connect/token
